// Module c-rpd: rapidly progressive dementia. Defining it, excluding delirium, searching
// systematically for the treatable causes with a tiered workup, starting immunotherapy when
// autoimmune encephalitis is likely, and recognizing sporadic Creutzfeldt-Jakob disease.

