      title: "Rapidly progressive dementia: look for what you can treat",
      concept: "When cognition collapses over weeks to months, the first job is to exclude delirium and then hunt systematically for the treatable causes, because several of them mimic prion disease and respond to treatment.",
      minutes: 9,
